BEGIN_PGML
The values of several definite integrals are given as follows:

[```\int_0^2f(x)\,dx = 5 \quad \int_0^3f(x)\,dx = 7 \quad \int_0^2g(x)\,dx = -3 \quad \int_2^3g(x)\,dx = 5```]

Use these values and properties of definite integrals to evaluate the indicated definite integral.

Find a formula for [`a`] in terms of [`b`] such that [`\ds \int_0^3 \big(af(x)+bg(x)\big) \, dx=0\text{.}`]

[_]{$a}{20}

END_PGML

